All of these are apparently the final hosts of SARS-CoV.
In the next search for a natural animal host SARS-CoV, a type of corona that had a lot of affiliation with a bat coV, called SARSR-Rh-BatCoV HKU3, was found to have lived in Chinese horseshoe bat.
